<title>UK: No UK bids at EU grain tender.</title>
<headline>No UK bids at EU grain tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain traders placed no bids at the European Union (EU) tender on Thursday, the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
